---
title: A2A Client Agent Graph
---
graph TB
    Start([Start]) --> Agent[Agent Node<br/>LLM Decision Maker]
    
    Agent --> Decision{Tool Calls<br/>Needed?}
    
    Decision -->|Yes| Action[Action Node<br/>Execute A2A Tools]
    Decision -->|No| End([End])
    
    Action --> ToolChoice{Which Tool?}
    
    ToolChoice -->|New Query| QueryTool[query_a2a_agent<br/>Send to A2A Server]
    ToolChoice -->|Follow-up| ContinueTool[continue_a2a_conversation<br/>Multi-turn Context]
    
    QueryTool --> A2AServer[A2A Server<br/>HTTP/JSON-RPC]
    ContinueTool --> A2AServer
    
    A2AServer --> ServerAgent[Server Agent<br/>Tools + Helpfulness]
    
    ServerAgent --> Result[Return Result]
    Result --> Agent
    
    Agent --> End
    
    style Start fill:#1e3a5f,stroke:#ffffff,stroke-width:3px,color:#ffffff
    style Agent fill:#4a148c,stroke:#ffffff,stroke-width:3px,color:#ffffff
    style Decision fill:#0d47a1,stroke:#ffffff,stroke-width:3px,color:#ffffff
    style Action fill:#1b5e20,stroke:#ffffff,stroke-width:3px,color:#ffffff
    style QueryTool fill:#2e7d32,stroke:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff
    style ContinueTool fill:#2e7d32,stroke:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff
    style A2AServer fill:#e65100,stroke:#ffffff,stroke-width:3px,color:#ffffff
    style ServerAgent fill:#c62828,stroke:#ffffff,stroke-width:3px,color:#ffffff
    style End fill:#424242,stroke:#ffffff,stroke-width:3px,color:#ffffff

